usage: QF_solver [-h] [--version] [--debug]
                 {solve,check-mesh,inspect,evidence,import-mesh,benchmarks,benchmark,vnv-compare,vnv-import-benchmark,convert-model,inspect-large,solve-large,generate-large-tet4-block,benchmark-large,large-campaign,large-preconditioners,large-scaling-report,petsc-profile-report,petsc-tuning-report,postprocess-large,large-readiness,qualify-large,verify-large,verify-evidence,verify,verify-tet10,verify-hex8,verify-hex8-campaign,verify-hex8-external,verify-contact,verify-all,qualification-readiness,maturity-promotion,owner-review-check,qualify,release-vv,methods} ...

QF_solver finite element solver CLI.

positional arguments:
  {solve,check-mesh,inspect,evidence,import-mesh,benchmarks,benchmark,vnv-compare,vnv-import-benchmark,convert-model,inspect-large,solve-large,generate-large-tet4-block,benchmark-large,large-campaign,large-preconditioners,large-scaling-report,petsc-profile-report,petsc-tuning-report,postprocess-large,large-readiness,qualify-large,verify-large,verify-evidence,verify,verify-tet10,verify-hex8,verify-hex8-campaign,verify-hex8-external,verify-contact,verify-all,qualification-readiness,maturity-promotion,owner-review-check,qualify,release-vv,methods}
    solve               solve a JSON finite element model
    check-mesh          validate a JSON model mesh
    inspect             write a white-box audit for a JSON model
    evidence            solve a model and write a reproducible evidence bundle
    import-mesh         import a Gmsh MSH 4.1 mesh and companion setup
    benchmarks          list controlled meshed mechanical benchmarks
    benchmark           run one controlled meshed benchmark
    vnv-compare         compare normalized QF_solver and reference results and
                        write a Markdown study
    vnv-import-benchmark
                        create a V&V study with PNG and VTU evidence from a
                        controlled benchmark
    convert-model       convert JSON model to large HDF5/NPZ format
    inspect-large       write an aggregated audit for a large model
    solve-large         solve a large-scale linear static TET4 model
    generate-large-tet4-block
                        generate a structured large TET4 block
    benchmark-large     solve a large model and write benchmark evidence
    large-campaign      plan or execute a multi-size large TET4 campaign
    large-preconditioners
                        compare PETSc preconditioners on one model
    large-scaling-report
                        analyze completed strong/weak scaling runs
    petsc-profile-report
                        parse and compare PETSc log_view profiles
    petsc-tuning-report
                        compare PETSc tuning runs across topologies
    postprocess-large   recover TET4 fields by checkpointed bounded-memory
                        chunks
    large-readiness     check dependencies and sizing before a large TET4 run
    qualify-large       generate, solve and verify a large TET4 case
    verify-large        verify a completed large qualification evidence
                        directory
    verify-evidence     verify an evidence bundle manifest
    verify              run existing MITC4 verification
    verify-tet10        run analytical TET10 mechanical verification
    verify-hex8         run analytical HEX8 mechanical verification
    verify-hex8-campaign
                        run the internal HEX8 V&V campaign
    verify-hex8-external
                        run the HEX8/CalculiX C3D8 correlation
    verify-contact      run the internal V1 normal and frictional contact
                        studies
    verify-all          run repository checks from a complete Git source
                        checkout (developer/CI only)
    qualification-readiness
                        check requirement traceability for one scope
    maturity-promotion  audit evidence readiness for the controlled maturity-
                        promotion plan
    owner-review-check  validate one Owner/external review record without
                        changing maturity
    qualify             run a qualification campaign manifest
    release-vv          build the release-level verification and validation
                        readiness package
    methods             list available analysis methods

